WEEK 6 — FIRST SCANNER AND MID-SEMESTER DEMO

Date: Monday, 14 September 2026

Problem: The scanner read QR codes only, so in the demo it read the QR code on the tag instead of the EAN-13 barcode, and a restart lost all data.

Solution:
- Used Type barcode and catalog search during the demo so it could continue.
- Logged the scanner problem as the top issue for Iteration 3.
- Logged the in-memory data loss as the second issue for Iteration 2.
- Took the demo feedback into the requirements: separate customer and cashier logins.
- Decided that the cash desk handles cash only.
